*> vybe-test: cobol/data_group_level/data_group_level05_values_display
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_data_group_level.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EMPLOYEE.
   05 EMP-NO   PIC 9(6) VALUE 100001.
   05 EMP-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "JOHN      ".
   05 EMP-DEPT PIC X(3) VALUE "IT".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY EMP-NO.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING EMP-NO DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "100001"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [100001] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY EMP-NAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING EMP-NAME DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "JOHN      "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [JOHN      ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY EMP-DEPT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING EMP-DEPT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "IT "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [IT ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

